flowchart TD
    A([Employer posts job]) --> B{Mode?}
    B -- Standard --> C[Hunters apply / bid before application deadline]
    C --> D[Employer compares applicants]
    D --> E[Employer selects one Hunter]
    E --> F{Hunter accepts?}
    F -- Declines --> C
    F -- Accepts --> G[Other applicants rejected · payment ledger Pending]
    G --> H[Hunter submits work vN]
    H --> I{Employer review}
    I -- Revision requested --> H
    I -- Approved --> J[Job Completed · payment Approved]
    J --> K[Employer records simulated payment → Paid]
    K --> L[Both parties may rate once]
    B -- Challenge --> M[Up to N Hunters join after accepting rules]
    M --> N[Participants submit; server timestamps]
    N --> O{Earliest pending submission passes review?}
    O -- No: rejected --> P[Next earliest becomes reviewable; rejected participant may resubmit before deadline]
    P --> O
    O -- Yes --> Q[Winner recorded once · others closed · winner payment Approved]
    Q --> K
